["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あちら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那边；那个方向；那里；远处；那个；那个人；那边；那里；外国（尤指西方国家）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217779\">こっちの<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあっちの<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりやさしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些书比那些书简单。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/3667782\" title=\"Tatoeba · inkarl\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · inkarl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あちらこちら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">到处；各处；四面八方；到处都是；混乱；混杂；顺序颠倒；颠三倒四</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192844\">ヨーロッパをあちらこちら<ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在欧洲旅行到这里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あっ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">啊；哦；嘿；喂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪化</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あっか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恶化；变坏；加剧；退化；腐化</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122956\"><ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>経<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つにつれて、<ruby>天気<rp>(</rp><rt>てんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>次第<rp>(</rp><rt>しだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>悪化<rp>(</rp><rt>あっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しつつあった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">随着日子的流逝,天气逐渐恶化。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呆気ない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あっけない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">令人失望的；不尽人意的；仓促的；不充分的；太快的；太短的；很快就结束的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182676\"><ruby>休暇<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつもあっけなく<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">假期总是很快结束。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪口</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あっこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">辱骂；谩骂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あっさり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轻易；顺利；迅速；干脆地（拒绝）；清淡（饮食、妆容等）；朴素；简洁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"114945\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあっさり<ruby>罪<rp>(</rp><rt>つみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>白状<rp>(</rp><rt>はくじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他迅速宣布自己的罪恶。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">圧縮</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あっしゅく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">压缩；浓缩；缩短；概括；（数据的）压缩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211522\">その<ruby>気体<rp>(</rp><rt>きたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>圧縮<rp>(</rp><rt>あっしゅく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されてボンベに<ruby>詰<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>め<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体被压缩并被包围在泡沫中。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あっち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那边；那个方向；那里；远处；那个；那个人；那边；那里；外国（尤指西方国家）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217779\">こっちの<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあっちの<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりやさしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些书比那些书简单。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/3667782\" title=\"Tatoeba · inkarl\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · inkarl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">圧迫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あっぱく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">压力；压迫；压制；压迫；镇压</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208677\">その<ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>国民<rp>(</rp><rt>こくみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>圧迫<rp>(</rp><rt>あっぱく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">政府压迫了人民。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アップ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">上升；增加；提高；抬起；涨价；上传；在线发布；特写；特写镜头；杀青；完成拍摄；上卷发型；盘发造型；领先；处于领先地位；得分领先；热身；准备活动；完成；结束；做完</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83780\"><ruby>物価<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>アップしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">价格每天都在上涨。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">厚い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厚；深；重；亲切；热情；好客；温暖；忠实；（病情）严重；丰厚；充裕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205578\">それは４ｃｍの<ruby>厚<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它的厚度为4厘米。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暑い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">炎热；闷热；酷热；热情的；激情的；炽热的（欲望等）；引人关注的；时下热门的；备受瞩目的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201579\">どうして、こんなに<ruby>暑<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么这么热呢?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">熱い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">热；烫；滚烫；热烈；炽热；火热；急躁；易怒；热情洋溢；热血；激烈；剧烈；极端；热门；受关注的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147486\"><ruby>熱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いコーヒーを<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてあげましょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把它加热的咖啡。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">扱い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">待遇；处理；应对；管理；操作；使用；作为……对待；把……当作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111175\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はピストルの<ruby>扱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>注意<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>欠<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他对枪的处理不太注意。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">扱う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつかう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对待；款待；招待；处理；应对；解决；操作；使用；运用；买卖；经营；销售；论述；讨论；涉及；把A当作B对待；视A为B；调停；调解；难以应付；力所不及；说闲话；背后议论</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145520\"><ruby>心理学<rp>(</rp><rt>しんりがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>感情<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>扱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">心理学对待人类的情绪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">厚かましい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつかましい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厚颜无耻；恬不知耻；厚脸皮；放肆；冒昧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"107432\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>厚<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かましくも<ruby>助<rp>(</rp><rt>たす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けを<ruby>求<rp>(</rp><rt>もと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めてきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他非常热情地寻求帮助。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">集まり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつまり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">聚集；集会；集合；出席</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223384\">このパーティーは<ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>した</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まりです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这次聚会是亲戚的聚会。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">集まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">聚集；汇集；集合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125642\"><ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りに<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がたくさん<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">街上有很多人聚集在一起。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">集める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">收集</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>弟<rp>(</rp><rt>おとうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>切手<rp>(</rp><rt>きって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">弟弟在集邮。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">誂える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつらえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">订制；定制；下单</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159419\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はデパートでオーバーをあつらえた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在公寓里转过身来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">圧力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">压力；压力（如政治压力）；施压</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180139\"><ruby>橋<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>圧力<rp>(</rp><rt>あつりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">桥落在压力下。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宛</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">目标；目的；对象；期望；前景；希望；可以依靠的东西；寄托；酒肴；下酒菜；垫；护具；打击；一击；寄往；发往；每；每个</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230696\">あの<ruby>人達<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>助力<rp>(</rp><rt>じょりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあてにできないよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们的帮助,我无法在那里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">当て</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">目标；目的；对象；期望；前景；希望；可以依靠的东西；寄托；酒肴；下酒菜；垫；护具；打击；一击；寄往；发往；每；每个</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209721\">その<ruby>時計<rp>(</rp><rt>とけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>正確<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>当<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てにできる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个手表可以准确地计算。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">当て字</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あてじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">借用汉字作为音标的字；音标字；代用字；日语中的当て字；根据汉字含义而不按其通常读音使用的汉字</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宛名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あてな</span>