"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189518\"><ruby>雨天<rp>(</rp><rt>うてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>晴天<rp>(</rp><rt>せいてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">风暴过后，太阳出来了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/7768231\" title=\"Tatoeba · jiangche\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · jiangche\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">跡継ぎ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あとつぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">继承人；嗣子；继任者；后继者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">後回し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あとまわし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">推迟；延后；拖延</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206431\">その<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>後回<rp>(</rp><rt>あとまわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しにしよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个问题,让我们稍后解决。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">穴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">孔；洞；开口；穿孔；坑；凹陷；洞穴；窟窿；洞穴；兽穴；巢穴；窝；亏损；缺口；财务漏洞；损失；空缺；空位；空档；缺位；漏洞；缺陷；不足；薄弱环节；破绽；鲜为人知的好地方；隐藏的秘密；冷门；爆冷；黑马；包厢；隔间式座席（传统日式剧院的地板座位）；躲藏处；隐蔽处；藏身之地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126362\"><ruby>注意<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して！<ruby>道路<rp>(</rp><rt>どうろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>穴<rp>(</rp><rt>あな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があいてるよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">要小心,街道上有洞。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アナウンサー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">播音员；主持人；广播员；记者；（综艺节目中负责外景轻松报道的）电视台内部艺人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234281\">アナウンサーは<ruby>早口<rp>(</rp><rt>はやくち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广告商可以提前发言。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あなた</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">你；亲爱的；老公（妻子对丈夫的称呼）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200726\">どちらの<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があなたのものですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪本书属于你?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">兄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哥哥；兄长；大伯子；姐夫（配偶的兄长或姐姐的丈夫）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74148\">これは<ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>あに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。かっこいいですね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这就是哥哥,可爱啊。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">姉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">姐姐；姊姊</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141894\"><ruby>先月<rp>(</rp><rt>せんげつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>姉<rp>(</rp><rt>あね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は６ポンドの<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">上个月,妹妹生了一个6英镑的男孩。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あの</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那个；那些；那</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231361\">あのおいしいワインをなぜ<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まないんだい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么不喝这种美味的葡萄酒?</span></div></li>"]